### ====================================================================
### Cocos Capital Challenge - API REST Collection
### ====================================================================
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### 1. Consultar Portfolio Valorizado (Usuario 1)
# Retorna: totalAccountValue, availableCash, y lista de posiciones con rendimiento diario y total.
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/users/1/portfolio
Accept: application/json

### 2. Buscar Activo por Ticker (ej: YPFD)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/instruments?query=YPFD
Accept: application/json

### 3. Buscar Activo por Nombre Parcial (ej: Galicia)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/instruments?query=galicia
Accept: application/json

### 4. Listar Todos los Instrumentos
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/instruments
Accept: application/json

### 5. Enviar Orden MARKET BUY por Cantidad de Acciones (Idempotente)
# Compra 10 acciones de PAMP al último precio close de mercado
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7a8b-9c0d-1e2f3a4b5c6d

{
  "userId": 1,
  "instrumentId": 47,
  "side": "BUY",
  "type": "MARKET",
  "size": 10
}

### 6. Reenviar Misma Orden con Misma Idempotency-Key (Prueba de Idempotencia)
# Debe retornar exactamente la respuesta previa sin duplicar la transacción
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7a8b-9c0d-1e2f3a4b5c6d

{
  "userId": 1,
  "instrumentId": 47,
  "side": "BUY",
  "type": "MARKET",
  "size": 10
}

### 7. Enviar Orden MARKET BUY por Monto en Pesos
# Calcula size = floor(amount / price)
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: b2c3d4e5-f6a7-8b9c-0d1e-2f3a4b5c6d7e

{
  "userId": 1,
  "instrumentId": 47,
  "side": "BUY",
  "type": "MARKET",
  "amount": 25000.00
}

### 8. Enviar Orden LIMIT BUY con Precio Límite
# Ingresa con estado NEW
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: c3d4e5f6-a7b8-9c0d-1e2f-3a4b5c6d7e8f

{
  "userId": 1,
  "instrumentId": 47,
  "side": "BUY",
  "type": "LIMIT",
  "size": 5,
  "price": 850.00
}

### 9. Enviar Orden con Fondos Insuficientes (Rechazo)
# Retorna estado REJECTED persistido
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: d4e5f6a7-b8c9-0d1e-2f3a-4b5c6d7e8f9a

{
  "userId": 1,
  "instrumentId": 47,
  "side": "BUY",
  "type": "MARKET",
  "size": 10000000
}

### 10. Cancelar Orden Pendiente (Estado NEW)
# Cancela la orden y transiciona su estado a CANCELLED
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/v1/orders/5
Accept: application/json
